<title>USA: American Water in deal with Agra.</title>
<headline>American Water in deal with Agra.</headline>
<dateline>VOORHEES, N.J. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Water Works Co Inc said Tuesday its AmericanAnglian Environmental Technologies affiliate is in an alliance with AGRA Inc of Canada to pursue business opportunities across Canada.</p>
<p>The alliance, named Allied Water, will seek opportunities for the financing, development and operation of municipal water and wastewater treatment plants.</p>
<p>AmericanAnglian is a joint venture between American Water Works Co and American Water Works PLC. Both companies are in the water utility business.</p>
</text>
